{"id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-lattice-re.md","title":"c.e. 集合格及其模有限商","display":"df-lattice-re — c.e. 集合格及其模有限商","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-lattice-re","aliases":["20-df-lattice-re"],"display":"df-lattice-re — c.e. 集合格及其模有限商","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§2.1.7；Exercise 2.1.17","source_pdf_pages":[63],"source_printed_pages":[27],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-mod-finite]]","[[20-thm-re-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-lattice-re"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-lattice-re</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lattice-re — c.e. 集合格及其模有限商"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§2.1.7；Exercise 2.1.17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集合族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6642949679a7c44\" href=\"?note=c6642949679a7c44\" title=\"20-thm-re-closure\">20-thm-re-closure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\mathbb E:=(\\mathcal E,\\subseteq),\\qquad\n\\mathbb E^*:=(\\{[A]^*:A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\le^*),\\qquad\n[A]^*\\le^*[B]^*\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq^*B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\mathbb E:=(\\mathcal E,\\subseteq),\\qquad\n\\mathbb E^*:=(\\{[A]^*:A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\le^*),\\qquad\n[A]^*\\le^*[B]^*\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq^*B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E\">\\(\\mathbb E\\)</span> 标记结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 标记载体，修复旧稿以同一个符号同时作集合和有序对的混用。商顺序良定义，因为有限改变不改变模有限包含。本书 §2.1.7 简要介绍了该结构；其深层自动同构理论不属于本书相应章节。</p>\n<p>来源：§2.1.7；Exercise 2.1.17；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee